  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "SEBSCC Nutrient and Chlorophyll Data",
  "description": "Biogenic nutrient (nitrate, nitrite, ammonium, phosphate and silicate) and Phytoplankton chlorophyll data were collected from CTD/rossette casts on selected SEBSCC cruises on the SE Bering Sea shelf.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: The purpose of the nutrient and chlorophyll data collection was to assess the nutrient environment with respect to physical processes and/or biological uptake and regeneration processes.",
